<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.5400 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.5400 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5400 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.6000 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Mar 5		   Mar 4</p>
<p> High			     75.5010		 75.5000</p>
<p> Low				75.6400		 75.6650</p>
<p> Open			     75.6200		 75.5000</p>
<p> Close			    75.5400		 75.6000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    3.485		   3.830</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Mar 5		   Mar 39</p>
<p> High			     45.0300		 45.0500</p>
<p> Low				45.0500		 45.0500</p>
<p> Open			     45.0500		 45.0500</p>
<p> Close			    45.0300		 45.0500</p>
<p> Volume (DM million)	   0.010		   0.010</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
